OL,3,GNEWSA'I want people to see sharks in a
OL,4,Adifferent light to Hollywood movies'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrom Grimsby to the Gulf of California,
OL,7,Fmarine biologist Dr Darren Whitehead
OL,8,Fhas built a career studying sharks and
OL,9,Fencouraging people to see beyond their
OL,10,Ffrequent media portrayal as man-eaters.
OL,12,FAlthough the Lincolnshire coast is not
OL,13,Fknown for sharks, Darren said he had
OL,14,Falways "liked an underdog story".
OL,16,F"I've been amazed by how people have so
OL,17,Fmuch fear of sharks and they've never
OL,18,Fseen a shark in their entire life.
OL,20,F"Hollywood and all these movies have
OL,21,Fjust kind of influenced our opinion and
OL,22,Fperception of sharks.
